error BYN1069: attribute `@inline` is not allowed before a statement

  2 │     @inline
    │     ^^^^^^^ before a statement
    │
  help: remove the attribute; only `@unobservable` may come before a statement

error BYN1069: attribute `@allow` is not allowed before a statement

  9 │     @allow(unusedValue) because "kept"
    │     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ before a statement
    │
  help: remove the attribute; only `@unobservable` may come before a statement
